Package: pctax
Type: Package
Title: Professional Comprehensive Omics Data Analysis
Version: 0.1.8
Authors@R: 
    person("Chen", "Peng", email ="bfzede@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9449-7606"))
Description: Tools for microbiome and other omics data, including alpha and
    beta diversity, differential abundance, community assembly, phylogenetic
    trees and functional enrichment. Community assembly includes the
    normalized stochasticity ratio of Ning, Deng, Tiedje and Zhou (2019)
    <doi:10.1073/pnas.1904623116> and the neutral model of Sloan et al. (2006)
    <doi:10.1111/j.1462-2920.2005.00956.x>. The suggested packages 'linkET',
    'pairwiseAdonis' and 'sankeyD3' are not available from CRAN or
    Bioconductor. Install 'linkET' from <https://github.com/Hy4m/linkET>
    and 'sankeyD3' from <https://github.com/fbreitwieser/sankeyD3>.
    Install 'pairwiseAdonis' from
    <https://github.com/pmartinezarbizu/pairwiseAdonis>;
    the package directory is 'pairwiseAdonis'.
